			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 29, DX 13, IQ 4, HT 12, HP 29, WILL 10, PER 12, FP 10, SPEED 6.5, MOVE 11, DODGE 10, DR 3. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
